From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SacredTrees <121399723+SacredTrees@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 22:31:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Amiga port: XML through OXP, the Open XML Parser, in place of
 libxml2

USE(OXP) (on for the Amiga port) builds XMLDocumentParserOXP.cpp in place of
XMLDocumentParserLibxml2.cpp and links OXP (DalsinAI/openamigaxml, oxp/)
instead of libxml2. The new file is the libxml2 one with the parser's
creation, feeding, stopping, position, entities and errors moved onto OXP.
XMLDocumentParserOXPBridge.h passes OXP's events to XMLDocumentParser in
libxml2's shapes, so its tree building is unchanged. The bridge is tested
on its own against libxml2's events.

- Entities: XHTML documents get the HTML named character references through
  OXP's resolve_entity. maximumXMLParserEntityExpansionCount becomes OXP's
  max_entity_refs.
- No external entity or DTD is loaded; libxml2 loaded same-origin ones.
- XSLT and EME (both need libxml2) stop the configure with USE(OXP).
